sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant API as EvalHub API<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Init as eval-runtime-init<br/>(Init Container)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Adapter as Eval Adapter<br/>(lm-eval, Garak, etc.)
    participant Sidecar as eval-runtime-sidecar<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Model as Model Endpoint<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,OCI: Flow 1: Evaluation Job Execution (Kubernetes Runtime)

    User->>KRP: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>Auth: OAuth/Bearer Token
    KRP->>API: Forward with X-Tenant, X-User headers<br/>TLS terminated
    API->>MLflow: Create experiment & run<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    MLflow-->>API: Experiment ID, Run ID
    API->>K8s: Create Job (init + adapter + sidecar)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8s-->>API: Job created

    Note over Init,S3: Init Container Phase
    Init->>S3: Download test datasets to /test_data<br/>Auth: AWS static credentials (IRSA)
    S3-->>Init: Dataset artifacts

    Note over Adapter,OCI: Evaluation Phase
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Model inference request<br/>HTTP (pod-local, no auth)
    Sidecar->>Model: Forward with credential injection<br/>Auth: Ref Token resolution / SA Token fallback
    Model-->>Sidecar: Inference response
    Sidecar-->>Adapter: Proxied response

    Adapter->>Sidecar: Log metrics to MLflow<br/>POST /api/2.0/mlflow/*
    Sidecar->>MLflow: Forward with Bearer Token<br/>Auth: File-based token (5-min cache)
    MLflow-->>Sidecar: OK
    Sidecar-->>Adapter: OK

    Adapter->>Sidecar: Publish eval card<br/>OCI v2 API
    Sidecar->>OCI: Push artifact<br/>Auth: Docker config.json + challenge-response
    OCI-->>Sidecar: Published
    Sidecar-->>Adapter: OK

    Adapter->>Sidecar: Job status update<br/>POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}/events
    Sidecar->>API: Forward status callback<br/>Auth: K8s SA Token (5-min cache)
    API-->>Sidecar: ACK
    Sidecar-->>Adapter: ACK

    Note over User,OCI: Flow 2: MCP Agent Interaction

    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant MCP as evalhub-mcp<br/>3001/TCP or stdio

    Agent->>MCP: MCP Tool: submit_evaluation<br/>Streamable HTTP or stdio
    MCP->>API: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    API-->>MCP: Job created (job_id)
    MCP-->>Agent: Tool result (job_id, status)

    Agent->>MCP: MCP Tool: get_job_status<br/>job_id
    MCP->>API: GET /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    API-->>MCP: Job details + progress %
    MCP-->>Agent: Tool result (status, progress)
